  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 300 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Season the lamb shoulder with salt and black pepper.",
    "Heat the olive oil in the clay pot over medium heat.",
    "Sear the lamb shoulder until browned on all sides.",
    "Add the garlic, lemon juice, red wine, rosemary, thyme, and bay leaves to the clay pot.",
    "Cover the clay pot with a lid and transfer it to the preheated oven.",
    "Braise the lamb for 2.5 hours, or until tender.",
    "Remove the clay pot from the oven and let it cool slightly.",
    "Slice the lamb shoulder and serve with the braising liquid spooned over the top."
